Task 2 patch — fix the fail-open `EDUWEB_DEFAULT` in the overlap script.

Authored by DATA-EXEC 2026-08-08. NOT COMMITTED — handed to the CEO per the read-only lane.
Target: scripts/measure_finephrase_overlap.py, lines 141-145.

WHY THIS IS A FAIL-OPEN DEFAULT, NOT A TYPO
The current default is `sample/350BT`, and the docstring defending it cites FinePhrase's own
dataset card (`source_datasets: [HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu/sample-350BT]`). The card is wrong
about where the documents actually are. Run as-is the script reports ~0% collision and would be
believed, because the justification looks authoritative. MEASURED 2026-08-08: the same FinePhrase
file scores 0 hits across 3 `sample/350BT` files and 2,085 hits in ONE `data/CC-MAIN-2013-20` file.

--- a/scripts/measure_finephrase_overlap.py
+++ b/scripts/measure_finephrase_overlap.py
@@ -141,5 +141,32 @@
